### Login as Flood Recorder (Ward A)
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "flood.recorder.wardA",
  "password": "password"
}

### Login as Flood Supervisor
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "flood.supervisor",
  "password": "password"
}

### Login as National User (read-only)
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "national.user",
  "password": "password"
}